# picker-exit.qa (WP3): Ctrl+O prints and exits. The scenario ends with the
# quit the action performs, so the report is not written; the evidence is the
# exit code and the child's stdout (FEATURES A-046, A-050, A-051, A-058).
#
#   tools/qa/run-gui.ps1 -Sandbox <sandbox> -Exe <qa build> -ArgsLine "--show-path --qa-real-console" `
#       -Scenario crates/gui/qa/scenarios/picker-exit.qa -Out <dir> -StdoutFile <out.txt>
# Expected: exit code 0 and <out.txt> holds exactly one line, the selected transcript's path.
# Without --show-path (plain `--qa-real-console`) the file holds the Ledger export instead.
wait-loaded 30s
key ctrl-o
wait 2s
